first-order linear ODE in standard form.\n\n$$\n2 x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+8 x y-8 x=3+3 y\\,.\n$$\n\nAssume $x\\ne 0$." :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nConverting the given equation to standard form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&2 x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+8 x y-8 x=3+3 y \\\\ &2 x\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+(8 x-3)y=3+8 x \\\\ &\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\underbrace{\\left(\\frac{8 x - 3}{2 x}\\right)}_{P(x)}y=\\underbrace{\\frac{8 x + 3}{2 x}}_{Q(x)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the equation is written in standard form with $P(x)=\\frac{8 x - 3}{2 x}$ and $Q(x)=\\frac{8 x + 3}{2 x}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186693251 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d5f34eb-e188-53a9-ac39-1198a0d90992" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{y (8 x - 4)}{8 x}=\\frac{8 x + 1}{8 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693239} {:answer/id #uuid "84a4dbe8-b8a0-5a66-9c50-f6651f41f3d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{y (7 x - 3)}{8 x}=\\frac{8 x + 1}{8 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693245} {:answer/id #uuid "a3369807-a3a3-51ce-8371-798c9cce929e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{y (5 x - 7)}{8 x}=\\frac{8 x + 1}{8 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693249} {:answer/id #uuid "e860b329-97e6-56c1-9003-0c0888a592a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} + \\frac{y (3 x - 1)}{8 x}=\\frac{8 x + 1}{8 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693259} {:answer/id #uuid "f7592c46-4c1a-53f7-85f1-832283c13406" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\fra